{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034600/extras/17963a0293e3ab1889c86140e7e5e027.avif?t=1761460167\" width=600 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034600/extras/5b76caea602153075a636e3417381675.avif?t=1761460167\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034600/extras_big/5b76caea602153075a636e3417381675.webp?t=1761460167 width=1560 height=851 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Introduction.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the East Europa Continent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this continent, many wars have been waged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People are exhausted, farmland was barren, and the rivers ran red with blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through several wars and revolutions,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 East and West Great Powers and 6 Buffer States emerged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the leader of one buffer state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival as a nation and as a leader with under the influence of Great Power.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034600/extras/17963a0293e3ab1889c86140e7e5e027.avif?t=1761460167\" width=600 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034600/extras/0f21e796a1d368cee10a5c75e7ecbbc2.avif?t=1761460167\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great leader of you will get Cards and Budgets to using cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make full use of the Cards and Budget, control opponent nations, survive, and lead to prosperity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will get a Influence when you using Cards to opponent nations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Influence reaches certain level, you will get a Card and control opponent nation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034600/extras/17963a0293e3ab1889c86140e7e5e027.avif?t=1761460167\" width=600 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034600/extras/7ef071f9ef9f7fac5ceca3def370f418.avif?t=1761460167\" width=1060 height=596 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Overview.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can optimize your Starting Deck Cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards for your Starting Deck can be get by opening Card Packs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034600/extras/17963a0293e3ab1889c86140e7e5e027.avif?t=1761460167\" width=600 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034600/extras/6ad71e1100d09b92367ac7a179d040a9.avif?t=1761460167\" width=1042 height=586 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crisis.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are so many crisis are coming to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger, Revolution, War, Support Rate ,Gandhi and so on...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Card, over the crisis, and lead to prosperity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://sh